#       with the formal stack Dennis asked for.
#
# ✒ Description:
#     Keeps installed packages, logs and editor or OS clutter out of version
#     control. Vendored KaTeX under vendor/ is source and stays tracked.
#
# ✒ Key Features:
#     - Ignores node_modules and npm logs.
#     - Ignores OS and editor files.
#     - Ignores local test output (screenshots, traces).
#
# ✒ Other Important Information:
#     - Dependencies: none
#     - Compatible platforms: Git 2.x on any OS
# ---------

node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
shots/
test-results/
__pycache__/
